# Changelog

All notable changes to this project are documented in this file. The format
follows Keep a Changelog.

## 0.1.0 - 2026-10-26

### Added
- Menu bar app that shows the headset battery level and charging state, with
  Refresh now and Launch at login.
- `--status`, `--listen`, `--device` and `-v` command line options.
- `BatteryCore` library with the frame builders, reply parser, query sequence
  and polling rules, plus unit tests.
- `build.sh`, which builds the Swift package and packages an ad-hoc signed app
  bundle.
- Python reference script for reading the battery over hidapi.
